    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d303">

                <pb facs="0893" n="881" xml:id="pg881"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.515/5–945</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5543</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-09">May 9, 1945</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        May 30.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to the
                    Department’s telegram 802, May 3, 1945, 6 PM,<anchor n="71" xml:id="d303-f1"/>
                    to the Legation, repeated to London, number unknown, approving certain changes
                    in the text of the provision to be incorporated in the so-called “Tripartite
                    Interim Trade Agreement” and the “Tripartite Post Hostilities Supply Agreement”,
                    and to transmit herewith five copies of the final draft of Annex A to this
                    agreement as informally presented to the Swedish Government.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Herschel</hi> V. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d303-a1.xml" xpointer="d303-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
